{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# Day 11 — Debugging, logging, profiling\n","Objectives:\n","- Use print vs logging.\n","- Basic profiling with timeit/cProfile.\n","- Identify hot spots and optimize."]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[],"source":["import logging, timeit\n","logging.basicConfig(level=logging.INFO)\n","\n","def slow_sum(n: int) -> int:\n","    s = 0\n","    for i in range(n):\n","        s += i\n","    return s\n","\n","logging.info('Running timeit...')\n","timeit.timeit(lambda: slow_sum(10_000), number=10)\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Exercises\n","1) Add logging to your CSV/JSON utilities.\n","2) Profile a function with timeit and then optimize it with vectorization."]}]}
